      "translationZh": "Claude in Chrome 已正式全面开放",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c7033a745d56573",
      "translationZh": "Compliance API 的覆盖范围扩展至 Claude Cowork 和 Claude Code",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8efdb74cc67b418",
      "translationZh": "用 Claude 变革组织的运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804ae5cd41268915",
      "translationZh": "订阅开发者通讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1392200d117522a4",
      "translationZh": "产品更新、操作指南、社区亮点，以及更多内容。每月发送到你的收件箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fc098e3bbb49641",
      "translationZh": "谢谢！你已成功订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
